KZ3 patch 1059 (SPU pass 46, queue 9l; upstream candidate; design from Killzone 2's patch 6005): sys_lwcond waiters in a per-lwcond FIFO (runtime/ppu/kz3_lwcond_fifo.h, a node on the waiter's stack woken by name): signal wakes the oldest, signal_all every waiter queued at the time, signal_to the named thread. Patch 0003's one counting semaphore per lwcond let a thread woken by signal_all re-wait and take a count meant for another waiter, which then slept on (KZ2: FIOS media-thread startup hang). Host test tools/spu/test_lwcond_fifo.sh reproduces the lost wakeup on the old algorithm and passes on the FIFO.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): wait on 1059's per-waiter FIFO, mutex through `lwm_release`/`lwm_acquire`.

